{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require Defibrillators and Bleed Kits on all Trains",
        "additional_details": "Passengers in this situation will likely be forced to do what they can with no medical equipment until they arrive at a train station. I've contacted the train companies and found that most trains do not have the equipment. Let us make the train companies spend their profits on at least one defibrillator or more per train. Put the passengers first.",
        "background": "I would like the Government to discuss and urgently introduce requirements for defibrillators and bleed kits on all trains. I am concerned about the risk of lives being lost to cardiac arrest whilst in transit on trains, before the train can reach a station where there is a defibrillator.",
